{"seq":2,"slug":"creative-variant-localize","title":"本地化创意变体生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/aigc-creative-production/creative-variant-localize","wordCount":2146,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"本地化创意变体生成\">本地化创意变体生成</h1><p>把一份英文创意翻译成十二种语言，得到的不是十二份本地化创意，而是一份英文创意加十二种语言转写。创意本地化的难点在于：文案的说服力依赖文化语境而非语义等价，画面里的符号、人物、场景、色彩都有在地含义。这一节讨论工程上如何组织本地化变体的生成，使得质量、成本与一致性三者可以同时维持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-翻译-创译与重创三种粒度\">核心概念：翻译、创译与重创三种粒度</h2><p>本地化不是单一操作，按对原创意的改动深度分三档，成本与效果依次递增：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>改动范围</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>单变体相对成本</th>\n<th>机器可自动化程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>翻译（translation）</td>\n<td>仅文案文本</td>\n<td>卖点中立、品类无文化壁垒</td>\n<td>1×</td>\n<td>高，可全自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创译（transcreation）</td>\n<td>文案表达方式 + 语气</td>\n<td>需要本地化表达习惯（幽默、敬语、口号）</td>\n<td>3–5×</td>\n<td>中，需人工定调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重创（recreation）</td>\n<td>文案 + 画面 + 场景 + 人物</td>\n<td>文化符号冲突、监管差异、审美差异</td>\n<td>10–30×</td>\n<td>低，需人工主导</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判断该用哪一档，工程上可以做成一个决策表，输入是市场、品类、卖点类型，输出是建议粒度。这个决策不该由每个运营凭经验做——不一致的粒度选择会导致某些市场的素材质量系统性偏低，而且很难在事后发现是&quot;粒度选错&quot;而不是&quot;生成质量差&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rules&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;when&quot;: { &quot;market&quot;: [&quot;JP&quot;, &quot;KR&quot;], &quot;sellingPoint&quot;: [&quot;discount&quot;, &quot;urgency&quot;] },&#10;      &quot;level&quot;: &quot;transcreation&quot;,&#10;      &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;促销紧迫感表达需本地化语气&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;when&quot;: { &quot;market&quot;: [&quot;DE&quot;, &quot;FR&quot;], &quot;hasPriceClaim&quot;: true },&#10;      &quot;level&quot;: &quot;transcreation&quot;,&#10;      &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;价格表述受法规约束，需本地重写&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;when&quot;: { &quot;market&quot;: [&quot;SA&quot;, &quot;AE&quot;], &quot;imagery&quot;: [&quot;person&quot;] },&#10;      &quot;level&quot;: &quot;recreation&quot;,&#10;      &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;人物与场景需按当地规范重选&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;when&quot;: { &quot;market&quot;: &quot;*&quot;, &quot;sellingPoint&quot;: [&quot;free-shipping&quot;] },&#10;      &quot;level&quot;: &quot;translation&quot;,&#10;      &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;卖点中立，无文化壁垒&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;default&quot;: &quot;transcreation&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"KR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sellingPoint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"discount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"urgency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"transcreation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"促销紧迫感表达需本地化语气\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hasPriceClaim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"transcreation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"价格表述受法规约束，需本地重写\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"imagery\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"person\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recreation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"人物与场景需按当地规范重选\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sellingPoint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"free-shipping\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"translation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"卖点中立，无文化壁垒\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"transcreation\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>默认值给 <code>transcreation</code> 而不是 <code>translation</code>，理由是粒度过高只会多花钱，粒度过低会产出无效素材——后者的代价更大且更隐蔽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变体树的展开方式\">变体树的展开方式</h2><p>本地化变体天然是一棵树，而不是一次广播。树的第一层是语言，第二层是市场内的方言或地区差异，第三层是渠道表达差异。展开成树而不是平铺列表的价值在于：共享的计算只做一次。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[&quot;源创意 en-US&lt;br/&gt;approved version&quot;] --&gt; L1[&quot;ja-JP&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; L2[&quot;de-DE&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; L3[&quot;pt-BR&quot;]&#10;  L1 --&gt; L1a[&quot;ja-JP / tiktok&lt;br/&gt;短句 + 竖版&quot;]&#10;  L1 --&gt; L1b[&quot;ja-JP / meta-feed&lt;br/&gt;敬语 + 方版&quot;]&#10;  L2 --&gt; L2a[&quot;de-DE / gdn&lt;br/&gt;含单价声明&quot;]&#10;  L3 --&gt; L3a[&quot;pt-BR / tiktok&lt;br/&gt;本地支付方式提及&quot;]&#10;  L3 --&gt; L3b[&quot;pt-BR / edm&lt;br/&gt;长文案 + 主题行&quot;]\">graph TD\n  S[\"源创意 en-US&lt;br/&gt;approved version\"] --&gt; L1[\"ja-JP\"]\n  S --&gt; L2[\"de-DE\"]\n  S --&gt; L3[\"pt-BR\"]\n  L1 --&gt; L1a[\"ja-JP / tiktok&lt;br/&gt;短句 + 竖版\"]\n  L1 --&gt; L1b[\"ja-JP / meta-feed&lt;br/&gt;敬语 + 方版\"]\n  L2 --&gt; L2a[\"de-DE / gdn&lt;br/&gt;含单价声明\"]\n  L3 --&gt; L3a[\"pt-BR / tiktok&lt;br/&gt;本地支付方式提及\"]\n  L3 --&gt; L3b[\"pt-BR / edm&lt;br/&gt;长文案 + 主题行\"]</pre><p>叶子节点是真正的生成任务，但中间节点承载上下文——一旦确定了 <code>ja-JP</code> 的卖点表达，它的所有渠叶子共享这份表达，只在长度约束上做裁剪。如果平铺处理，同一个卖点的日语表达会被独立生成三次，结果大概率是三种不同说法，这在同一市场并行投放时看起来像两家不同的公司。</p>\n<h3 id=\"上下文继承的实现\">上下文继承的实现</h3><p>树形展开要求生成任务的输入里携带父节点的决定。实现上不需要建树表，只需要让任务记录父任务 ID 与继承字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"ALTER TABLE generation_task&#10;  ADD COLUMN parent_task_id bigint REFERENCES generation_task(task_id),&#10;  ADD COLUMN inherits      text[] NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 父任务产出决定后，子任务才入队&#10;INSERT INTO generation_task&#10;  (idempotency_key, task_type, locale, placement, market, template_id,&#10;   template_version, model_id, params, parent_task_id, inherits)&#10;SELECT :key, &#39;copy&#39;, &#39;ja-JP&#39;, &#39;tiktok-infeed&#39;, &#39;JP&#39;, &#39;tpl-promo-jp&#39;, 3,&#10;       &#39;text-gen-large&#39;,&#10;       jsonb_build_object(&#39;maxChars&#39;, 40, &#39;tone&#39;, p.result_tone),&#10;       p.task_id, ARRAY[&#39;tone&#39;,&#39;keyMessage&#39;]&#10;  FROM generation_task p&#10; WHERE p.task_id = :parent AND p.status = &#39;succeeded&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> generation_task</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN parent_task_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> generation_task(task_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN inherits      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 父任务产出决定后，子任务才入队</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> generation_task</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (idempotency_key, task_type, locale, placement, market, template_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   template_version, model_id, params, parent_task_id, inherits)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'copy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ja-JP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tiktok-infeed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'JP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tpl-promo-jp'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">       'text-gen-large'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       jsonb_build_object(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'maxChars'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tone'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">result_tone</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">task_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">['tone','keyMessage']</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D