ss=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{locale} + N_{locale} \\times N_{placement\\_tail}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中尾部只做长度裁剪这类便宜操作。这一项通常能省掉一半以上。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，缓存命中。</strong> 大量位置对同一母版、同一语言、同一版式的重复请求会命中呈现件缓存（见 <a href=\"../creative-dam-model/market-channel-asset-reuse\">按市场×渠道的素材复用</a> 的输入指纹设计）。这一项省的是重复，不减少新内容的成本。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，批内复用。</strong> 同一批次内，多个位置的文案可以在一次模型调用里生成（一次请求返回多条候选），摊薄固定开销。这一项效果随批次大小递减，且会牺牲一点单条的精细度。</p>\n<p>需要注意的是降本不能以牺牲复核为代价。生成成本每降低一档，人工复核的必要性就上升一档——因为低成本的生成往往来自更强的模板约束，而模板约束越强，模板本身的错误就越会成比例放大到所有产出上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与合规的衔接\">与合规的衔接</h2><p>本地化产出的素材要进入第 3 章的审批环节。这里有一个必须提前处理的耦合：<strong>合规规则是按市场定义的，而本地化是按语言组织的</strong>。语言与市场不是一对一——葡萄牙语覆盖巴西与葡萄牙，规则完全不同；阿拉伯语覆盖多个司法辖区。因此本地化任务的输出必须按<strong>市场</strong>而不是语言落库与送审，语言只是生成时的参数。</p>\n<p>这条约束的反面案例很常见：系统的语言维度做了独立索引，运营查&quot;所有葡语文案&quot;时看到的是混在一起的巴西与葡萄牙素材，误把巴西的促销表述用到葡萄牙站。领域模型上，素材的市场归属是主键的一部分，语言只是它的一个属性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>本地化按改动深度分翻译、创译、重创三档，用决策表统一下判断，默认偏向创译。</li>\n<li>变体按树展开，中间节点承载语言级决定，叶子共享上下文，避免同一卖点出现多种译法。</li>\n<li>术语与语气靠术语表加后置校验双保险，仅进提示词不可靠。</li>\n<li>复数模板先按 CLDR 的复数类别展开再创译，否则俄语、阿拉伯语的语法分支会被压扁。</li>\n<li>画面重创保持品牌色、产品形态、版式骨架三样不变，改变人物、场景、道具与背景。</li>\n<li>降本三手段：共享中间产物、缓存命中、批内复用，效果依次递减；降本同时必须加强复核。</li>\n<li>素材按市场落库送审，语言只是生成参数——语言与市场不是一对一映射。</li>\n<li>上一节 <a href=\"ai-copy-image-video-gen\">AI 文案/图/视频批量生成</a> 定义的任务契约是本节展开的基础；产出进入 <a href=\"human-review-brand-guard\">人工审校与品牌一致性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"本地化创意变体生成","id":"本地化创意变体生成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：翻译、创译与重创三种粒度","id":"核心概念-翻译-创译与重创三种粒度"},{"level":2,"text":"变体树的展开方式","id":"变体树的展开方式"},{"level":3,"text":"上下文继承的实现","id":"上下文继承的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性的三个来源","id":"一致性的三个来源"},{"level":3,"text":"术语与语气的一致性","id":"术语与语气的一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"复数与性别的一致","id":"复数与性别的一致"},{"level":3,"text":"画面元素的一致性","id":"画面元素的一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"批量本地化的成本控制","id":"批量本地化的成本控制"},{"level":2,"text":"与合规的衔接","id":"与合规的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"AI 文案/图/视频批量生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/aigc-creative-production/ai-copy-image-video-gen"},"next":{"title":"人工审校与品牌一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/aigc-creative-production/human-review-brand-guard"}}